{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_2000_situation", "source_sha256": "5166757dbef9a3b166453c20057dce8d71a9d2aed12360bea81c52dddc8bfbd8", "ja": "CDのお渡し会　開始前", "zh": "CD发售会　开始前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_2000_place", "source_sha256": "37c195ee998b87db6f8310c2e29359ee3cf1babff38970811a76c2b593ad12b5", "ja": "お渡し会開催店", "zh": "发售会举办店铺", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_2001_p", "source_sha256": "71fd1060b3b9ae8abe11808335fa514bef12ae42b3444bf615316a9ed71ac1f8", "ja": "今日の仕事は、CDのお渡し会だけど……。\n未来、お渡し会では何をすればいいか、わかるか？", "zh": "今天的工作是CD发售会……\n未来，你知道发售会应该做些什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_2002_014mir", "source_sha256": "364b17b8e13d0468cf6d68fa2f33b2deb4f8767ddbf28b8953f322512498839b", "ja": "えっと……。CDを手渡すんだと思います！\n……あれっ？　合ってますよね？", "zh": "呃……就是亲手把CD交出去！\n……咦？我应该没说错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_2003_p", "source_sha256": "8d771dcd6dce15d6ba0aa719ea19b5f5bd784351642ef112f9e2c142a2d040fb", "ja": "間違ってないけど、それだけじゃないな！\n応援してくれるファンの声を聞くのも、大事な仕事だ。", "zh": "是没有说错，但并不只是如此！\n聆听支持自己的粉丝的声音，也是重要的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_2004_014mir", "source_sha256": "f3ebcb1f0221899e755b281ac2b83c3b366c20db65ef0d33dc9ea6310a83466b", "ja": "そっかぁ……それなら、私にまかせてください！\n私、おしゃべりするのは得意なんです♪", "zh": "这样啊……那样的话，请包在我身上！\n我很擅长和人聊天♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_2005_014mir", "source_sha256": "6f48bdf4c6d9c5e7424b53a333b48034416b34dcbb7fa05d209f5c23a34ee33c", "ja": "みんなに喜んでもらえるといいなー♪\nそうだ、今のうちに……。", "zh": "希望能让每个人都开心～♪\n对了，就趁现在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_014mir_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_014mir_2006_014mir", "source_sha256": "98f8d96e45ecac8f7988b5c1bf3edf87300bdd5fe7d1079b498f7e9724011550", "ja": "かえるぴょこぽこ、みぺこぺこ……\nよし、バッチリです！　じゃあ、いってきまーす♪", "zh": "石狮寺有四十四只石狮子……\n好，很完美！那么，我上场啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
